
# portfolio

## loading
- the initial portfolio loader begins closing after 1600 milliseconds regardless of image preload completion @spec @implemented
- portfolio images preload from the smallest responsive tier to larger tiers and unfinished work continues after the loader closes @implemented
- the fixed loader window prioritizes smallest thumbnails while larger preload tiers use limited background concurrency to avoid blocking hover frames @implemented

## interaction
- portfolio hover samples the project title under the pointer on the next animation frame after pointer movement or scrolling and enqueues every crossed project in traversal order @spec @implemented
- portfolio hover schedules no animation frames while the pointer is idle and the hover queue has no decoded project ready to advance @spec @implemented
- project title hover feedback and preview images advance by one queued project per rendered frame without transition animation @spec @implemented

## images
- portfolio list previews render the 300-pixel thumbnail immediately and upgrade the active preview to the full-quality image once loaded, and detail views progressively upgrade from LQIP and 300-pixel preview to the full-quality image @implemented
- while the portfolio list is open, every crossed project receives one rendered frame with its decoded 300-pixel thumbnail before the queue advances @spec @implemented

# projects
- the portfolio lists telnyx-voice-agent with matching metadata, description, and cover image in both language mirrors @spec @implemented
